{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p069b","title":"袁绍麹义界桥战破公孙瓒斩严纲追拔营","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p069b-account","label":"《英雄记》","text":"袁绍麹义界桥战破公孙瓒斩严纲追拔营","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-cf01c5f598e6412e845c","label":"正文","text":"绍军广宗令麹义先登与瓒战生擒严纲","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-a3300d797c003993c578"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"统军","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0116","role":"破军","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0093","role":"战败","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0117","role":"被斩","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0104","role":"被生擒","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-a3300d797c003993c578"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"界桥及冀州诸战时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p069b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p069b-q","source_order":[6,277,"P069b"],"order":1644},{"id":"gongsuntao-e-o025","title":"瓒进军界桥署严纲田楷单经三州","accounts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-a-d7d8215fda9e7b338fed","label":"正文","text":"瓒进军界桥署严纲田楷单经三州","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0093","role":"兵益盛进军界桥、以严纲为冀州田楷为青州单经为兖州置诸郡县","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0104","role":"为冀州","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0017","role":"为青州","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]},{"person":"wudi-p0094","role":"为兖州","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","source_order":[8,51,117],"order":1941},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o128a","title":"蒋秘南讨廖式杀严纲与弟廖潜攻郡吕岱唐咨讨平","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o128a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"蒋秘南讨廖式杀严纲与弟廖潜攻郡吕岱唐咨讨平","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0102","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0103","role":"叛乱","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0104","role":"被杀","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0105","role":"起兵","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0086","role":"征讨","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0088","role":"征讨","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":239,"label":"冬十月起岁余","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y239","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o126","basis":"冬十月起岁余"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o128a-q","wuzhu-q-o126","houfei-q-o050","shaodi-q-o002","mingdi-q-o068","mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o128a-q","source_order":[47,675,"O128a"],"order":8346}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0104","name":"严纲","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o128","gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","gongsuntao-q-a3300d797c003993c578"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o128-wuzhu-p0104","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o128"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p069b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-e78509101d005195918b","layer":"pei","quote":"绍自往征瓒，合战于界桥南二十里。瓒步兵三万余人，为方阵；骑为两翼，左右各五千余匹；白马义从为中坚，亦分作两校；左射右，右射左；旌旗铠甲，光照天地。绍令麹义以八百兵为先登；强弩千张夹承之；绍自以步兵数万，结阵于后。义久在凉州，晓习羌斗，兵皆骁锐。瓒见其兵少，便放骑欲陵蹈之。义兵皆伏盾下不动，未至数十步，乃同时俱起；扬尘大叫，直前冲突；强弩雷发，所中必倒。临阵斩瓒所署冀州刺史严纲，甲首千余级。瓒军败绩，步骑奔走，不复还营。义追至界桥，瓒殿兵还战桥上，义复破之。遂到瓒营，拔其牙门；营中余众，皆复散走。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":276,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14470fffeafe6a651893","start":52,"end":302,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b2ad847988834f852565","layer":"original","quote":"兵益盛，进军界桥〖9〗。﹝二﹞以严纲为冀州〖10〗，田楷为青州，单经为兖州，置诸郡县","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":117,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-a3300d797c003993c578","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b2ad847988834f852565","layer":"original","quote":"绍军广（川）〔宗〕〖12〗，令将麹义先登与瓒战〖13〗，生擒纲","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":164,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o050","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6dc749ac781a81d5a82f","layer":"original","quote":"帝疾困，遂立为皇后。齐王即位，尊后为皇太后，称“永宁宫”。追封谥太后父满，为西都定侯，以立子建绍其爵。封太后母杜，为郃阳君。芝迁散骑常侍、长水校尉；﹝一﹞立，宣德将军〖2〗；皆封列侯。建兄德，出养甄氏。德及建，俱为镇护将军〖3〗，皆封列侯，并掌宿卫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗三年：景初三年（公元 239）。丁亥：旧历初一日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":496,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-271e1436daf6e49feb83","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o068","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o002","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-69d95c2d10b2c4a40b0c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，立为齐王。景初三年正月，丁亥朔，帝病甚，乃立为皇太子。是日，即皇帝位。大赦。尊皇后曰皇太后〖2〗。大将军曹爽、太尉司马宣王辅政。诏曰：“朕以眇身〖3〗，继承鸿业。茕茕在疚〖4〗，靡所控告〖5〗。大将军、太尉奉受末命〖6〗，夹辅朕躬；司徒、司空，冢宰元辅总率百僚〖7〗，以宁社稷；其与群卿大夫勉勖乃心〖8〗，称朕意焉。”诸所兴作宫室之役，皆以遗诏罢之；官奴婢六十以上，免为良人〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o128a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-43c4e115f962534e3553","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，将军蒋秘南讨夷贼。秘所领都督廖式，杀临贺太守严纲等〖2〗，自称“平南将军〖3〗”；与弟潜，共攻零陵、桂阳，及摇动交州、苍梧、郁林诸郡〖4〗，众数万人。遣将军吕岱、唐咨讨之，岁余皆破。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o126","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab932a5023f68052057f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春三月〖1〗，﹝一﹞遣使者羊衜、郑胄、将军孙怡，之辽东，击魏守将张持、高虑等，虏得男女。﹝二﹞零陵言甘露降。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o128","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-43c4e115f962534e3553","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，将军蒋秘南讨夷贼。秘所领都督廖式，杀临贺太守严纲等〖2〗，自称“平南将军〖3〗”；与弟潜，共攻零陵、桂阳，及摇动交州、苍梧、郁林诸郡〖4〗，众数万人。遣将军吕岱、唐咨讨之，岁余皆破。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
